Package: didimdwiki
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Markdown wiki engine
 didimdwiki is a small personal wiki written in C. Pages are Markdown files
 on disk, with revision history, sessions, CSRF protection, file uploads,
 a JSON API and a systemd service unit. There is no database.
 .
 Listens on 127.0.0.1:8888 by default; put nginx (or similar) in front
 for TLS.
